        "Description": "Additional [/Script/BeastsOfBermuda.ServerGameInstance] lines that do not have their own AMP field. One full raw line per entry, including the key. Import does NOT fill this box. Saving with this box empty deletes those leftover lines from this heading.\n\nDo not use a + prefix. Do not add FlushServerData or ForceSaveData. Never write an empty SteamGroupName=. Uncomment a commented example to enable it.\n\nPlace ProfanityWords, AutoMessages, SteamWorkshopFoliageSaveItemIDs, GameServerLoginToken, and bUpdateFoliageFilesFromWorkshop above every !ClearArray line.\n\nDo not add !AdminRanks=ClearArray, !AdminCommandRules=ClearArray, or !ServerAdmins=ClearArray unless you intend to wipe those arrays.\n\nArrays (paste the ClearArray line immediately before that array when you need one):\n!ServerAdmins=ClearArray\nServerAdmins=(UserSteamId64=76561198000000000,AdminRank=\"Verified\")\n!PlayerChatColors=ClearArray\nPlayerChatColors=(SteamID=76561198000000000,ChatColor=(R=1,G=0.2,B=0,A=1.0))\n!PlayerChatTags=ClearArray\nPlayerChatTags=(SteamID=76561198000000000,ChatTag=\"Developer\")\nAdminRanks=(AdminRank=\"DefaultAdmin\",RankLevel=5)\nAdminCommandRules=(CommandType=EAdminCommands::RestartMap,MinimalRank=\"Verified\")\n!CreatureLimits=ClearArray\nCreatureLimits=(CreatureType=EDinoType::Utahraptor,PercentAllowed=100.0f,GroupLimit=8,SoftCapStart=0.6f,SoftCapEnd=0.7f)\n!GrowthLimits=ClearArray\nGrowthLimits=(Type=EDinoType::Utahraptor,Limit=20.0f)\nProfanityWords=http\nAutoMessages=(Message=\"Hourly ping\",IntervalMinutes=60,Alert=false)\n\nAdmin ranks are free-text names; they must match AdminCommandRules MinimalRank values. Closing \") must be present. GrowthLimits must be Limit=20.0f not Limit=Limit=. PercentAllowed 0 still lets one player use that species. The Overpopulation growth debuff is meant for Free Roam; on Life Cycle it only slows growth to about Free Roam rates.\n\nAutoMessages: IntervalMinutes repeats the message; UTCTime fires once per day and is unreliable; Alert=true also shows an announcement.\n\nServer Admin Passwords (ServerAdminPassword) accept multiple comma-separated passwords. Uncomment ;ServerAdminPassword=ChangeMe1,ChangeMe2 and replace the placeholders. AMP does not write an empty ServerAdminPassword=.\n\nAdminAllowedCommands / AdminBlockedCommands (advanced, untested since 12 April 2026, many incompatibilities):\nAdminAllowedCommands=(PlayerId=76561198000000000, Commands=(\"ForceStorm\", \"KickPlayer\"))\nAdminBlockedCommands=(PlayerId=76561198000000000, Commands=(\"RemoveAllCarcasses\"))\n\nSteamGroupName must never be written empty. If Require Steam Group To Join is false, omit SteamGroupName entirely. RCON is broken and discouraged; do not add empty Engine, RCON, or DDoS headings. Hard group configs are unfinished and buggy. bUseMixedHerdCaps is broken: keep it false. Standing on assets such as BurrowBoulder02_C can cause DoS-level log spam, so keep TunnelNetworkDespawnTime low if you uncomment it.",
